        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Natural gas, liquefied, at freight ship
Remark: The process is normalized on the gaseous form of gas.
Included processes: This dataset describes the transport of natural gas  (expressed in tkm)  on a freight ship between Algeria and the evaporation plant in Europe.
Location:  Geography: Data stems of reference book published in 1999 and is not specific for a country.
Technology: Technology: This new edition of Cerbe's reference book on natural gas describes actual technology
Time period: Unspecified
Production volume: Production volume: 15E09 Nm3
Sampling: &lt;null&gt;
Extrapolations: none
Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_be7711af-15bd-3602-8cf7-03625656fe69.xml</text>
